{"sourceUrl":"https://naoep.whut.edu.cn/zsjy/yjszs/202609/t20260917_1418213.shtml","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:54:10.185292+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://naoep.whut.edu.cn/zsjy/yjszs/202609/t20260917_1418213.shtml","html":"<div>\n<div><h2><span><span><span>一、申请条件</span></span></span></h2><p><span><span><span><span>1.</span></span></span></span><span><span>符合学校规定的推免生申请基本条件。</span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>2.</span></span></span></span><span><span>本科期间学习成绩优良、品德表现良好，无违纪处分记录。</span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>3.</span></span></span></span><span><span>能取得就读高校推荐免试资格的</span></span><span><span><span>2027</span></span></span><span><span>届应届本科毕业生。</span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>4.</span></span></span></span><span><span>入学前须取得本科毕业证书和学士学位证书。</span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>5.</span></span></span></span><span><span>申请直接攻读博士学位者，应具有较强的科研创新能力和培养潜力，在报名前与拟报考导师联系，取得导师同意后报考，并致电备案。</span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>6.</span></span></span></span><span><span>本科毕业专业：毕业专业与报考招生专业相近，如船舶与海洋工程类（船舶与海洋结构物设计制造、轮机工程、水声工程、绿色船舶与环境保护等）、能源动力类（动力工程及工程热物理）、力学类（流体力学、工程力学等）、土木工程类（结构工程、岩土工程等）、水利类（港口航道与海岸工程等）等相关专业。</span></span></p><h2><span><span><span>二、招生类别和招生人数</span></span></span></h2><h3><span><span>（一）本科直博生</span></span></h3><center><div><table><thead><tr><td><p><span><span><span><strong>序号</strong></span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span><strong>专业名称</strong></span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span><strong>专业代码</strong></span></span></span></p></td><td colspan=\"2\"><p><span><span><span><strong>学习形式</strong></span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span><strong>拟招生人数</strong></span></span></span></p></td></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><p><span><span><span>1</span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>船舶与海洋工程</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span>082400</span></span></span></p></td><td colspan=\"2\"><p><span><span>全日制</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span>7</